  "paragraph": "Nadine Bradley died on Day 263 of Year 15, aged 60, having never lived anywhere else. She is survived by her husband Marvin, her son Marcus, and her grandsons Ben and Leo, and was preceded in death by her husband Clifford. She asked three people for her money back. She leaves an estate valued at $229,012. Two people burned joss paper. She is not expected to stay away long."
